{
  "info": {
    "name": "OzAgriMate API v1 - Assignment 4",
    "description": "Tests the 8 documented REST endpoints with success and error cases. Start the services first with `python run_all.py` (fresh in-memory data), then run the folders in order. Identity headers stand in for the claims the API Gateway forwards after JWT validation.",
